<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 16 August <span class="n">8</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/azzone-visconti"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/azzone-visconti.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Azzone Visconti</span><span class="tp">1302–1339</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/wenceslaus-iv-of-bohemia"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/wenceslaus-iv-of-bohemia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Wenceslaus IV of Bohemia</span><span class="tp">1361–1419</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ranavalona-i"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ranavalona-i.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ranavalona I</span><span class="tp">c. 1778–1861</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/andrej-hlinka"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/andrej-hlinka.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Andrej Hlinka</span><span class="tp">1864–1938</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/alidius-tjarda-van-starkenborgh-stachouwer"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/alidius-tjarda-van-starkenborgh-stachouwer.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Alidius Tjarda van Starkenborgh Stachouwer</span><span class="tp">1888–1978</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/idi-amin"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/idi-amin.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Idi Amin</span><span class="tp">c. 1925–2003</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/alfredo-stroessner"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/alfredo-stroessner.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Alfredo Stroessner</span><span class="tp">1912–2006</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/atal-bihari-vajpayee"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Atal Bihari Vajpayee</span><span class="tp">1924–2018</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
